    <string name="help_faq">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How do I subscribe?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Open Profile ▸ Subscription, pick a plan and complete the payment. All premium episodes and movies unlock instantly.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">How many devices can I use?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Free and Basic: 1 device. Premium: 2 devices. VIP Annual: 4 devices. Manage them from Profile ▸ Devices.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How do I download to watch offline?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Tap the download icon next to any episode or movie (subscription required). Find them in Profile ▸ Downloads.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">Video is not playing or keeps buffering</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Check your internet connection, then close and reopen the app. If the problem continues, contact support.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">How do I change the language?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Go to Profile ▸ App language. You can also choose Hindi or Gujarati content from Profile ▸ Content language.</string>
